es. So there  is a guy who created this e-com product where it's   a book where your dad can answer a couple of  questions and basically tell his story so that   you can have some good memories of them And he  was making ads using archives Again he needed to   have a grandpa talking in a nice setup That would  probably be very hard to get without AI. And look   at this ad, 200,000 likes. That probably got a  couple of millions of views on this one single   ad. Love this. People are commenting super nice  stuff. And again, AI generates. So yeah, just   wanted to mention it works very well for apps. It  works very well for services, but it also works   for e-com. And maybe I can go back to Arcades  and show you more advanced stuff that people   can do to create these ads. Yeah. By the way, on  this, I'm pretty sure I saw this ad on TikTok. I   saw this as an ad on TikTok. So if you create, ,  this is so good that it could be organic content,   but it can also be an ad. So that's another  thing is, , you can use ads as organic content,   too. , why not, right? 100%. Yeah, we have so many  of our customers crushing it on TikTok shop. So,   you know, TikTok, now you can, , be paid to  create content to promote other products.   and that's a very good way to kickstart when you  don't have too much cash flow because you don't   even need to pay for the TikTok ads budget. All  you need is make good content and it's probably   the best way to learn how to make good content  because on Facebook ads, if you put budgets,   you will have views. But on TikTok, if your video  is not good, you would get literally 200 views   maximum. So it's probably the best way and the  cheapest way to learn how to create good content.   And actually some of our most active customers,  they created those TikTok accounts, and those are   literally 18 years old. They created these TikTok  accounts where they create content using AI,   and some of them are really crushing it. I might  have an example somewhere. Let me see if I can   find this one. Yeah, so we have this kid in Latin  America who is making TikTok videos organically,   purely, so no paid marketing at all. And so he  starts with kind of a very shocking crook about   the news. He's talking about the news the fires in  California. And so, yeah, this guy was generated   with archives for the non-Spanish speakers. So  basically he talks about the news. And then he   introduced a startup where he has an affiliate  link through the TikTok shop affiliate platform   to promote the product. and that he basically  took content from the brands that they went   to Shark Tank and he combined those into a video  and he made 1.1 million views purely organically.   And I think he made more than 30K from this one  video that was completely blowing up. So yeah,   organic is a very good usage. Obviously, most of  our users do pay ads because we focus on companies   and mostly they have budget and they can go and  spend on paid platforms, but you can also create   this kind of content using ArcEd. There's two  things I want to cover that's important for me   to cover before we go, which is I didn't know  that you can use VO3 within ArcEd, so I'd love   to understand how you can actually do that. And  the last thing I want to cover is, you know this   I want to the era I'm in is the vibe marketing  era and how do you automate as much as this is   possible so I'd love for you to tell me the best  ways I can automate some of my ads maybe using   tools Gumloop and stuff that 100% yeah let's do  that so by the way one of the best ways to create   a winning ad is to copy something that is already  getting good results So we are going to show you   exactly how you can automate that with tools  GAMLOOP, NA10, et cetera. But you can also do it   in a more manual way if you're not that technical.  We have this feature called Speech to Speech where   you can go and download an existing video from  a competitor. So for example, 